@startuml
[*] --> Normal: Initial state

Normal:
    when Adjust button pressed --> Editing Time
    when Alarm toggle pressed --> Alarm Off
    when Light button pressed --> Light On

Editing Time:
    when Hour selected --> Adjusting Hour
    when Minute selected --> Adjusting Minute

Adjusting Hour, Adjusting Minute, Adjusting Alarm Hour, Adjusting Alarm Minute:
    when Increase button pressed --> self (loop after max)

Alarm Off:
    when Alarm toggle pressed --> Alarm On

Alarm On:
    when Current time matches alarm time --> Alarm Ringing

Alarm Ringing:
    when Stop button pressed --> Normal or Alarm Off
    when [*] reached --> [*]

Light On:
    when Button released --> Light Off

Light Off:
    when Button pressed --> Light On

Adjusting Hour, Adjusting Minute, Adjusting Alarm Hour, Adjusting Alarm Minute:
    when Back to Editing pressed --> Editing Time

Normal:
    when Alarm time matches current time and alarm is on --> Alarm Ringing
@enduml
